  - type: kart-grid
    baslik: Support at Famagusta Psychology Centre
    giris: Famagusta Psychology Centre offers flexible appointment times to fit around busy study schedules, with student-friendly pricing. Sessions are available in both English and Turkish, making the service accessible to international students as well as local ones.
