          - Morning, midday and evening slots
          - Full confidentiality guaranteed
          - Easy booking via WhatsApp
  - type: metin
    baslik: Why are online sessions particularly useful for students?
    metin: |-
      During exam periods time is tight, and your dorm or accommodation may be far from the centre. Online sessions remove these barriers: you can have a session before a lecture or in the early evening, from your own space, via a secure video connection.

      Research confirms that [online therapy](/en/blog/online-therapy-north-cyprus.html) is as effective as face-to-face therapy. Cognitive Behavioural Therapy (CBT) for anxiety and depression, in particular, works just as well online as it does in person.
  - type: bilgi-kutusu
    ton: turuncu
    baslik: Do not wait until things reach a crisis
    metin: Most students wait until things get worse. But therapy is most effective — and takes the shortest time — when problems are addressed early, before they deepen. If something feels wrong, that is reason enough.
